OL,3,GNEWSA'People don't care any more' -
OL,4,Acars blocking paths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says she is forced "almost
OL,7,Fevery day" to take her wheelchair on to
OL,8,Fbusy roads because of the number of
OL,9,Fcars parking on pavements near where
OL,10,Fshe lives.
OL,12,FCaroline Lewis, from Market Drayton in
OL,13,FShropshire, said "people don't care any
OL,14,Fmore" about how and where they park.
OL,16,FIt is not illegal to park on pavements
OL,17,Fin the county, but there can be hefty
OL,18,Ffines for those causing an unnecessary
OL,19,Fobstruction.
