OL,3,GNEWSA'People don't care any more' -
OL,4,Acars blocking paths
OL,5,
OL,6,FLewis, 63, who began using a wheelchair
OL,7,Ffollowing a crash involving a lorry,
OL,8,Fsaid people were "thoughtless" and
OL,9,Fshould be more considerate of those
OL,10,F"who aren't on two feet".
